<h2>Our <span>Engagement Model</span></h2>
<p class="intro">At Kreatazz Tech, we’re more than a technology partner—we drive innovation, efficiency, and growth.
Here’s why businesses across industries trust us to deliver exceptional results:</p>

<div class="why-grid">
<div class="why-card">
<div class="why-icon"><img src="https://kreatazz.tech/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ser-icon9-1.png" alt="Expertise Across Domains" /></div>
<h3>Technology Partnership</h3>
<p data-start="4978" data-end="5077">We embed our engineers into your teams and collaborate closely on product development and delivery.</p>
<p data-start="5079" data-end="5154">Best for:<br data-start="5088" data-end="5091" />Long-term product development and scaling engineering capacity.</p>

</div>
<div class="why-card">
<div class="why-icon"><img src="https://kreatazz.tech/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ser-icon12.png" alt="Customer Centric Approach" /></div>
<h3>Project Delivery</h3>
<p data-start="5183" data-end="5265">We take ownership of a defined technology project from architecture to deployment.</p>
<p data-start="5267" data-end="5331">Best for:<br data-start="5276" data-end="5279" />Building new platforms, MVPs, or enterprise systems.</p>

</div>
<div class="why-card">
<div class="why-icon"><img src="https://kreatazz.tech/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/counter-3.png" alt="Innovative Solutions" /></div>
<h3>Advisory and Consulting</h3>
<p data-start="5365" data-end="5465">Strategic consulting for technology decisions, architecture, and digital transformation initiatives.</p>
<p data-start="5467" data-end="5534">Best for:<br data-start="5476" data-end="5479" />Leadership teams planning major technology initiatives.</p>

</div>
</div>
</section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"456cb14","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<section id="why-kreatazz" class="container">
